        "content": "## SIMPLE 2 - All the triggers\nFive ways to start a flow. Each one tags itself, then they all meet in one node. Run each trigger once and compare the executions.\n\nManual: click. Webhook: open the URL in the browser (add ?name=you). Form: open the form URL. Chat: open the chat URL. Schedule: runs at 06:00 once the workflow is published.\n\nBefore use: set the Webhook path to yourname-hello and the Form path to yourname-form.",
